  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jingiella\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Jingiella\">Jingiella dongxingensis</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype specimen (<b>DXJL2021001</b>). Scale bar=1 m.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(DXJL2021001)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/08912963.2024.2309287\">\"The first mamenchisaurid from the Upper Jurassic Dongxing Formation of Guangxi, southernmost China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dinosaur.pref.fukui.jp/archive/memoir/memoir010-001.pdf\">\"Re-examination of Chuanjiesaurus anaensis (Dinosauria: Sauropoda) from the Middle Jurassic Chuanjie Formation, Lufeng County, Yunnan Province, Southwest China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/sauropods-and-kin/mamenchisaurus\"><i>Mamenchisaurus youngi</i> skeletal</a> by Scott Hartman</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/gunnarbivens/art/Mamenchisaurus-youngi-Skeletal-842926300\"><i>Mamenchisaurus youngi</i> skeletal</a> by Gunnar Bivens</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/javifel/art/Chuanjiesaurus-666158918\"><i>Chuanjiesaurus</i> skeletal</a> by javifel</li></ul>",
